"height":15},{"text":"실행(running):","x":379,"y":1270,"width":245,"height":43},{"text":"명령어들이","x":642,"y":1271,"width":171,"height":40},{"text":"실행되고","x":832,"y":1273,"width":140,"height":38},{"text":"있다.","x":986,"y":1272,"width":74,"height":38}]},{"text":"• 대기(waiting): 프로세스가 어떤 이벤트(입출력 완료 또는 신호의 수신 같은)가 일","words":[{"text":"•","x":338,"y":1357,"width":14,"height":15},{"text":"대기(waiting):","x":379,"y":1345,"width":236,"height":42},{"text":"프로세스가","x":634,"y":1346,"width":179,"height":39},{"text":"어떤","x":830,"y":1348,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"이벤트(입출력","x":916,"y":1347,"width":214,"height":42},{"text":"완료","x":1149,"y":1347,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"또는","x":1231,"y":1350,"width":69,"height":35},{"text":"신호의","x":1315,"y":1348,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"수신","x":1432,"y":1348,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"같은)가","x":1515,"y":1347,"width":117,"height":43},{"text":"일","x":1649,"y":1350,"width":28,"height":38}]},{"text":"어나기를 기다린다.","words":[{"text":"어나기를","x":380,"y":1408,"width":135,"height":40},{"text":"기다린다.","x":529,"y":1407,"width":146,"height":40}]},{"text":"• 준비(ready): 프로세스가 처리기에 할당되기를 기다린다.","words":[{"text":"•","x":338,"y":1497,"width":14,"height":15},{"text":"준비(ready):","x":377,"y":1484,"width":204,"height":44},{"text":"프로세스가","x":596,"y":1485,"width":179,"height":40},{"text":"처리기에","x":788,"y":1487,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"할당되기를","x":939,"y":1488,"width":172,"height":38},{"text":"기다린다.","x":1124,"y":1488,"width":142,"height":39}]},{"text":"• 종료(termmated): 프로세스의 실행이 종료되었다.","words":[{"text":"•","x":339,"y":1572,"width":15,"height":16},{"text":"종료(termmated):","x":378,"y":1563,"width":298,"height":39},{"text":"프로세스의","x":691,"y":1562,"width":174,"height":38},{"text":"실행이","x":882,"y":1563,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"종료되었다.","x":996,"y":1563,"width":178,"height":38}]},{"text":"이들 이름은 임의적이고, 운영체제마다 변한다. 그렇지만, 이들이 나타내는 상태들은 모","words":[{"text":"이들","x":320,"y":1692,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"이름은","x":401,"y":1691,"wi